        "description": "## Overview\n[litellm](https://pypi.org/project/litellm) is a Library to easily interface with LLM API providers\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Insufficient Session Expiration in the `authenticate_user` function. An attacker can gain unauthorized access or maintain access to sensitive information by exploiting session management flaws.\n## Remediation\nThere is no fixed version for `litellm`.\n## References\n- [GitHub Gist](https://gist.github.com/YLChen-007/39ed709ce322431658a05b951e91f278)\n- [Vulnerable Code](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/blob/main/litellm/proxy/auth/login_utils.py#L217)\n- [Vulnerable Code](https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/blob/main/litellm/proxy/auth/login_utils.py#L347)\n",
